<item>
<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-14T14:22:18.977Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:22:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran struck a U.S. military radar in Bahrain and launched drones that were shot down, while the United States responded by hitting Iran's Qeshm Island and disabling a commercial vessel in the Gulf of Oman. Iran also hit a building in Tel Aviv with a missile and opened a women’s war-readiness training camp, and it designated the Argentine navy and air force as terrorist organisations, warning of retaliation against European bases hosting U.S. forces. Qatar reported progress in U.S., Iran talks after a White House meeting, and France blamed Iran for a cyberattack on refrigeration systems. The crisis now includes a planned trilateral meeting of Trump, Xi and Putin in China. 123 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/asia-pacific/20261114-china-to-host-first-ever-trilateral-meeting-between-trump-xi-and-putin-next-week-us-says&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/13/iran-us-radar-bahrain-sirik-hormuz&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/14/un-says-25-seafarers-killed-in-around-hormuz-since-february?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/11/13/trump-falsely-claims-nobodys-been-killed-iran-war-last-five-months/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/11/12/trump-shuts-down-vance-iran-negotiating-efforts-says-no-deal-needed/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/14/trump-xi-putin-trilateral-meeting-at-apec-what-to-expect?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &